     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Hello!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">First, thank you for a\ngreat package!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I would\nlike to display my proportions not as a percentage but in decimal form (e. g. 43% in 0.43). Is this\npossible?</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Thank you for your response.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Aminata<br></span></p>\n\n</div>"
