    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Aminata,<div><br></div><div>First of all, many thanks for using the compareGroups package. Your feedback is very usefull.</div><div>By now, it is not possible not report proportions instead of percentages. We will incoporate the possibility to report proportions for categorical variables in the next version.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards,</div><div><br></div><div>Isaac.</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "PJwWi4pcEAAJ",
   "from": "Isaac Subirana",
   "author": "176185748932f5c0",
   "date": "2020-01-15T14:08:04Z",
   "subject": "Re: table format",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Aminata, <br><div><br></div><div>We just have added the option to report proporions instead of percentages for categorical row-variables.</div><div>By now, this update has been incorporated in the version available on github. To download it, type:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">devtools</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">devtools</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">install_github</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;isubirana/compareGroups&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></div></code></div><br>In order to report proportions, you must specify the new argument compute.prop = TRUE in the compareGroups or descrTable function. Below there is an example<br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">compareGroups</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">predimed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>cg </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> compareGroups</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> predimed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> compute</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>createTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># or directly using descrTable</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>descrTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,136)\">group</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">~</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.,</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> predimed</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> compute</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">prop</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">)</span></div><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>I hope it helps.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards,</div><div><br></div><div>Isaac.</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
